#
# Cross-platform CPU primitives for interrupt control and state inspection.
# Uses arch blocks to provide identical semantics on x86-64 and aarch64.
# The interrupt flag convention is normalized: bit 9 (value 512) in the
# returned flags indicates interrupts were enabled, matching x86 RFLAGS IF
# semantics on all architectures.
#
# This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
